# SHADOW VEIL — Chapter IV: Castle Hakuro

scene intro
  lock
  fade 1 0
  letterbox 1 0
  player face right
  player pose stand
  music silent
  camera player 3 -2 1.2 0
  wait 0.8
  narrate "The first snow fell the night Rei came down from the pass. By morning the road lay white, and so did the castle at its end."
  narrate "Lord Hakuro, the White Wolf, had held this valley for thirty years. In all that time, no one had climbed his walls and come back down."
  fade 0 3.0 nowait
  wait 1.6
  camera player 14 -3 0.85 4 nowait
  say REI "Hana's in there somewhere. And the children from Minase."
  say REI "Gunners on the road. Hounds. Lantern-towers on the walls."
  say REI "Then I go where the light isn't."
  camera player 3 -2 1.0 1.5
  title "第四章" "Chapter IV — Castle Hakuro" 4.5
  letterbox 0 1.2
  camera_release
  unlock
  request save
end

scene cells_see
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.6
  camera npc:hana -2 -1 1.05 2
  say REI "Hana."
  npc hana face left
  say HANA "Rei? Keep your voice down. They change the guard at the third drum."
  say HANA "The gate lifts from above. There's a winch over the far end of the block."
  say REI "Hold on."
  say HANA "I've been holding on for nine days. A little longer won't kill me."
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.6
  unlock
end

scene opened_ch4.cells
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.6
  sfx gate 0.8
  shake 0.3
  camera npc:hana 2 -1 1.0 1.6
  wait 0.8
  npc hana walk -3 120
  npc cap1 walk -4 100
  npc cap2 walk -4 110
  npc cap3 walk -3 100
  wait 1.6
  say HANA "Everyone up. Quietly. Hold the little ones' hands."
  say HANA "You came all this way."
  say REI "You left me your ribbon. I had to give it back."
  say HANA "…Keep it. It suits you better than that grim face."
  say HANA "I'll take them down the road the way we came. You're going up, aren't you? To him."
  say REI "Hakuro has a pact with my master. I need to know what it is."
  say HANA "Then go and ask him. Come back down to us after. Promise me that."
  say REI "I promise."
  npc hana walk -8 140
  npc cap1 walk -8 120
  npc cap2 walk -8 130
  npc cap3 walk -8 120
  wait 1.2
  npc hana fade 0 1.0
  npc cap1 fade 0 1.0
  npc cap2 fade 0 1.0
  npc cap3 fade 0 1.0
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.6
  unlock
  flag hana_freed
  request save
end

scene boss_intro
  lock
  letterbox 1 1.0
  music silent
  camera boss -4 -1 1.0 2.2
  wait 0.4
  say HAKURO "You climbed my walls, passed my hounds, and emptied my cells. Funaki warned me about you."
  say REI "You took a village to build a road. Where does it go?"
  say HAKURO "To the Mirror Province. To the place where the Veil runs thinnest, and a land no one has farmed in six hundred years waits behind it."
  say HAKURO "Your master asked for a road and the hands to build it. In return, the Hollow's valleys are mine when the Veil falls."
  say REI "There are people living in those valleys."
  say HAKURO "There are people living everywhere. That has never stopped anyone."
  sfx perilous
  shake 0.5
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.8
  unlock
  boss_start
end

scene boss_phase2
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.4
  camera boss 0 -1 1.1 0.6
  say HAKURO "Enough. To me, my wolves!"
  shake 0.6
  wait 0.4
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.4
  unlock
  hint summon
end

scene boss_outro
  lock
  letterbox 1 1.0
  music elegy
  wait 1.4
  camera boss 0 -1 1.3 2.2
  say HAKURO "…Thirty years. No one has put me on my knees in thirty years."
  say REI "Then stay there a while, and listen."
  say REI "The captives are going home. You'll send stone down to Minase for every roof your captain drowned. And the road ends here."
  say HAKURO "And if I refuse?"
  say REI "Then I come back. And next time I'll have been angry for longer."
  wait 0.8
  say HAKURO "…Very well. It ends here."
  say HAKURO "But your master is already gone. He took my best men to the Mirror Province six days ago."
  say HAKURO "He said the Veil is not a wall. It is a weave, held by a single pair of hands. He means to cut those hands free."
  say REI "Whose hands?"
  say HAKURO "He didn't say. Only that he had waited twenty years to see her again."
  wait 0.6
  narrate "In the courtyard below, the drums fell silent. One by one, the beacons on the walls went out."
  wait 0.6
  fade 1 2.5
  wait 0.4
  request chapter_end
end

scene shadow_awaken
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.5
  slowmo 0.4 1.2
  camera player 0 -1 1.3 1.0
  flash 0.3 2a2a40
  wait 0.6
  say REI "Be still, and the dark takes you in."
  toast "Shadow Stance awakened" "Crouch without moving for a moment and the shadows hide you, even from close by."
  hint shadow
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.5
  unlock
  request save
end
